@startuml state-payroll
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1C2230
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #1C2230
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1C2230
  FontColor #1C2230
  ArrowColor #1C2230
  StartColor #1C2230
  EndColor #1C2230
}

title Payroll state machine

[*] --> DRAFT : generate_payroll (owner)\nor the System Clock's\nautomatic draft (BR-14)

DRAFT : acknowledge_min_wage / warning acknowledged
DRAFT --> DRAFT : generate_payroll\n/ draft replaced,\nacknowledgements reset
DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : confirm_payroll\n[every minimum-wage\nwarning acknowledged]

CONFIRMED : read-only
CONFIRMED --> [*]
@enduml
